//
// roofshade.mes
// 
// Specifies the 3 alpha values used to shade roofs when
// the player is behind them.
//
// Message 0 is used for full opacity.
// Message 1 is used for partial opacity.
// Message 2 is used for full transparency.
//
// Each value must be in the range 0 - 255.
//
{0}{255}
{1}{200}
{2}{80}

